                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-110_l35" HPOS="726" VPOS="2273" WIDTH="1665" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="728 2318 2391 2314" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="728 2318 728 2334 2389 2330 2391 2314 2387 2285 1925 2273 1923 2273 1921 2273 1919 2273 1905 2285 1736 2285 1705 2273 1703 2273 1701 2273 1699 2273 1697 2273 1683 2285 1601 2285 1566 2273 1564 2273 1562 2273 1561 2273 1559 2273 1539 2287 1358 2287 1336 2275 1334 2275 1332 2275 1280 2285 1256 2275 1255 2275 1253 2275 1149 2285 1083 2275 1081 2275 1079 2275 1048 2285 958 2275 956 2275 726 2283 728 2318"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="In the folk-stories of Maritime provenience, however, “violent men” appear"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-110_l36" HPOS="619" VPOS="2334" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="621 2378 2389 2371" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="621 2378 621 2394 2387 2386 2389 2371 2387 2345 2346 2334 2344 2334 2342 2334 2340 2334 2311 2343 2252 2334 2250 2334 2248 2334 2247 2334 2231 2345 2112 2345 1987 2334 1985 2334 1983 2334 1943 2345 1902 2335 1900 2335 1898 2335 1896 2335 1865 2345 1777 2335 1775 2335 1773 2335 1752 2347 1629 2347 1504 2335 1502 2335 1500 2335 1455 2347 1397 2337 1395 2337 1393 2337 1371 2349 1093 2349 1065 2337 1064 2337 1062 2337 1060 2337 1034 2349 1021 2339 1019 2339 1017 2339 1015 2339 742 2349 678 2339 676 2339 619 2351 621 2378"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="quite often; and, in contrast to the Reindeer stories, the violent man is, for"/>
                    </TextLine>

